.venv/
data/
__pycache__/

# results/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Unlike data/ and adapters/, these are
# measurements, not regenerable inputs: reproducing them means paying for cloud
# GPU time again, and the README's numbers cite them. ~1MB of text reports and
# run JSON.
#
# Checked before un-ignoring: no result file carries a transcript field. The
# JSON holds per-decision verdicts whose `raw` includes the model's quoted
# EVIDENCE span, and V3-RECALL-DIAG.txt quotes 11 lines of a test script. All
# of it is from the written synthetic consultations (Dr Patel, Dr Morgan, Dr
# Osei) — no recordings and no real patient encounters, so this stays inside
# the "never commit recordings or transcripts" rule in the root .gitignore.
